          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I tripped. I lost my grip on your phone at step 2, so I stopped before touching anything else." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "做到第 2 步时跟手机断开了，我没再碰别的，先停下了。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lost connection to your phone at step 2, so I stopped right there."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "做到第 2 步時跟手機斷開了，我沒再碰別的，先停下了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the chat, the waveform button starts a live conversation: Poki listens, acts and answers out loud, also while you are in another app. It ends by itself 8 seconds after an answer if nobody speaks. Tap End to stop sooner. The microphone in the message field only dictates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In chat, tap the waveform button to start Live Voice. Poki listens, acts, and replies aloud, also while you are in another app. It ends automatically if nobody speaks for 8 seconds after an answer. Tap End to stop early. The message field mic is for dictation only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在对话中轻点波形按钮即可开启实时语音，Poki 会边听边操作并朗读回答，切到其他应用后对话继续。回答后 8 秒内无人说话会自动结束；轻点“结束”可提前停止。输入框麦克风仅用于听写。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在對話中輕點波形按鈕即可開啟即時語音，Poki 會邊聽邊操作並朗讀回答，切到其他 App 後對話繼續。回答後 8 秒內無人說話會自動結束；輕點「結束」可提前停止。輸入框麥克風僅用於聽寫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
