    "On the Voice page, holding the button starts a live conversation. Poki listens, acts and answers out loud. It ends by itself 8 seconds after an answer if nobody speaks, and when Poki goes to the background (once a running step is done). Slide up to end it sooner. The microphone in the message field only dictates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“语音”页按住按钮即可开始实时对话，Poki 会边听边操作并朗读回答。回答后 8 秒内无人说话，或切至后台（当前运行步骤完成后）时会自动结束；上滑可提前结束。输入框麦克风仅用于听写。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the Voice page, hold the button to start a live conversation. Poki listens, acts, and replies aloud. It ends automatically if nobody speaks for 8 seconds after an answer, or when Poki enters the background once a running step finishes. Slide up to end early. The message field mic is for dictation only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在「語音」頁按住按鈕即可開始即時對話，Poki 會邊聽邊操作並朗讀回答。回答後 8 秒內無人說話，或切至背景（目前執行步驟完成後）時會自動結束；上滑可提前結束。輸入框麥克風僅用於聽寫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Online" : {
      "localizations" : {
