        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 可在此 iPhone 上點按、輸入和滑動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki can't reach this iPhone. Check in this order: Setup › Loopback (your proxy app or LocalDevVPN is connected, with 10.7.0.1 set), then Setup › Pairing (pair again with the loopback on), then Developer Mode in Settings → Privacy & Security." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请依次检查：“配置 › 回环”（LocalDevVPN 或代理已连接且配好 10.7.0.1）、“配置 › 配对”（开启回环后重配）、“设置 › 隐私与安全”中的开发者模式。Poki 无法连接此 iPhone。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請依序檢查：「設定精靈 › 迴環」（LocalDevVPN 或代理已連線且配好 10.7.0.1）、「設定精靈 › 配對」（開啟迴環後重配）、「設定 › 隱私權與安全性」中的開發者模式。Poki 無法連接此 iPhone。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check Setup › Loopback (LocalDevVPN or proxy connected with 10.7.0.1), then pair again in Setup › Pairing, then check Developer Mode in Settings › Privacy & Security. Poki can’t reach this iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki can't use the microphone. Allow it in Settings, Privacy, Microphone." : {
      "localizations" : {
