    "Poki has no default relay. Deploy your own to your Cloudflare account with deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh from the Poki repository, then enter the address it prints. Screenshots and taps pass only through that relay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 没有默认中转。请用 Poki 仓库中的 deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh 把中转部署到你自己的 Cloudflare 账户，再输入它输出的地址。截图和轻点只经过这个中转。"
          }
