    "Poki needs the internet once after each restart of the phone to get Apple's signature for the developer disk image. Check Wi-Fi or cellular; Poki tries again by itself." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请检查 Wi-Fi 或蜂窝网络。手机重启后需联网一次获取 Apple 磁盘映像签名，Poki 会自动重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請檢查 Wi-Fi 或行動網路。手機重啟後需連網一次取得 Apple 磁碟映像簽名，Poki 會自動重試。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check Wi-Fi or cellular. After a restart, Poki needs internet once for Apple’s disk image signature and retries automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki shows steps, pairing codes, and approvals on the Lock Screen." : {
