    },
    "This iPhone does not answer at 10.7.0.1 on cellular. With the developer disk image still mounted, new tasks start without the loopback. Renewing, updating and mounting the image need Wi-Fi." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "蜂窝网络下，此 iPhone 在 10.7.0.1 没有应答。开发者磁盘映像仍已装载时，新任务无需回环也能开始；续签、更新和装载映像需要 Wi-Fi。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "行動網路下，此 iPhone 在 10.7.0.1 沒有應答。開發者磁碟映像仍已裝載時，新任務無需迴環也能開始；續簽、更新和裝載映像需要 Wi-Fi。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone does not answer yet. Enable Poki's local connection, or choose an external connection in Setup." : {
