    "iOS asked for the iPhone passcode to allow automation, but it was not entered. Turn Poki off and on, then enter the passcode." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 要求输入 iPhone 锁屏密码以允许自动化，但未完成输入。先关闭再开启 Poki，然后输入密码。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 要求輸入 iPhone 鎖屏密碼以允許自動化，但未完成輸入。先關閉再開啟 Poki，然後輸入密碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS asks after Poki restarts or 8 hours later. The agent waits." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
