        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重啟或滿 8 小時需驗證，智慧體等待中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS asks for it once after a restart. The agent waits." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重启后需验证一次，智能体等待中。"
