    "In the chat, the waveform button starts a live conversation. Poki listens, acts and answers out loud. It ends by itself 8 seconds after an answer if nobody speaks, and when Poki goes to the background (once a running step is done). Tap End to stop sooner. The microphone in the message field only dictates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在聊天中轻点波形按钮即可开始实时对话。Poki 会聆听、操作并朗读回答。回答后 8 秒内无人说话，或 Poki 进入后台（当前步骤完成后），对话会自动结束。轻点“结束”可提前停止。信息栏里的麦克风只用于听写。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在聊天中輕點波形按鈕即可開始實時對話。Poki 會聆聽、操作並朗讀回答。回答後 8 秒內無人說話，或 Poki 進入後臺（當前步驟完成後），對話會自動結束。輕點「結束」可提前停止。資訊欄裡的麥克風只用於聽寫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A live conversation uses OpenAI’s Realtime voice, which needs an OpenAI API key in Settings › Models. Dictation in the message field works with every model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实时语音使用 OpenAI Realtime，需在“设置 › 模型”中添加 OpenAI API 密钥。输入框听写支持所有模型。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
