    "Off by default. ask_poki lets outside agents hand a repetitive task to Poki's own agent. Changes take effect the next time Poki opens. The Auto-Classifier is in Settings › Approvals." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认关闭。ask_poki 允许外部智能体将重复性任务交给 Poki 内置智能体。下次启动生效。自动判断位于“设置 › 审批”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "預設關閉。ask_poki 允許外部智慧體將重複性任務交給 Poki 內建智慧體。下次啟動生效。自動判斷位於「設定 › 審批」。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off by default. ask_poki lets external agents hand repetitive tasks to Poki’s built-in agent. Takes effect next launch. Auto-Classifier is in Settings › Approvals."
          }
        }
      }
    },
