        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在第 %lld 步受阻"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki sends touches and keys over a screen-sharing session, and iOS turns the camera off in every app while one is open, so Poki opens it only for an action and closes it 5 seconds after the last one. With this on (the default), Poki opens no session at all, so the camera is never affected. If taps and typing stop working, turn it off. Takes effect the next time Poki turns on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 通过屏幕共享会话发送触控和按键，而会话打开期间 iOS 会关闭所有 App 的相机，因此 Poki 只在操作时打开会话，并在最后一次操作 5 秒后关闭。开启此项（默认）后，Poki 完全不打开会话，相机不受任何影响。如果轻点和键入失效，请关闭此项。下次开启 Poki 时生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 透過螢幕共享會話傳送觸控和按鍵，而會話開啟期間 iOS 會關閉所有 App 的相機，因此 Poki 只在操作時開啟會話，並在最後一次操作 5 秒後關閉。開啟此項（預設）後，Poki 完全不開啟會話，相機不受任何影響。如果輕點和鍵入失效，請關閉此項。下次開啟 Poki 時生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents can reach this iPhone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体可连接此 iPhone"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
