    "Ask Me" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "询问我"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "詢問我"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sensitive steps are paying, deleting, sending a message, placing a call, typing a password and anything in Wallet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "敏感步骤包括付款、删除、发送信息、拨打电话、键入密码，以及“钱包”中的任何操作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "敏感步驟包括付款、刪除、傳送資訊、撥打電話、鍵入密碼，以及「錢包」中的任何操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Message Reply, Poki asks you in the chat and your yes lets the step through. Away from Poki you can answer from the notification. Outside agents have no chat, so their steps ask with Allow and Don’t Allow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择“通过消息回复”时，Poki 会在对话中询问，回复“允许”即可放行；离开应用时也可在通知中操作。外部智能体无对话界面，会显示“允许”或“不允许”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選擇「透過訊息回覆」時，Poki 會在對話中詢問，回覆「允許」即可放行；離開應用程式時也可在通知中操作。外部智慧體無對話介面，會顯示「允許」或「不允許」。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With Message Reply, Poki asks in chat and a yes lets the step through, or you can answer from the notification. External agents have no chat, so they ask with Allow and Don’t Allow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Confirmation, you tap Allow or Don’t Allow on the Live Activity, in a notification, or here in Poki." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择“通过确认按钮”时，可在实时活动、通知或 Poki 内轻点“允许”或“不允许”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選擇「透過確認按鈕」時，可在即時動態、通知或 Poki 內輕點「允許」或「不允許」。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With Confirmation, tap Allow or Don’t Allow on the Live Activity, in a notification, or inside Poki."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents do all of that without asking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体执行以上操作时不再询问。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智慧體執行以上操作時不再詢問。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agents perform these actions without asking."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents controlling this iPhone via Poki" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过 Poki 控制此 iPhone 的智能体"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agents controlling this iPhone via Poki"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "透過 Poki 控制此 iPhone 的智慧體"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two ways to update: sign in and Poki updates itself here, or connect this iPhone to your Mac and use Poki Setup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "支持两种更新方式：登录账户在此直接更新，或连接 Mac 使用 Poki Setup 更新。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
