            "value" : "詢問最多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permissive. Your chat model approves a step in Poki’s own chat unless it clearly has nothing to do with what you asked, or you said no." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "宽松。在 Poki 自己的聊天中，除非某一步明显与你的要求无关或你已拒绝，否则聊天模型会批准。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "寬鬆。在 Poki 自己的聊天中，除非某一步明顯與你的要求無關或你已拒絕，否則聊天模型會批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Balanced. Your chat model approves a step in Poki’s own chat when it directly serves what you asked for. You are asked about the rest." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "均衡。在 Poki 自己的聊天中，某一步直接服务于你的要求时，聊天模型会批准。其余的会询问你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "均衡。在 Poki 自己的聊天中，某一步直接服務於你的要求時，聊天模型會批准。其餘的會詢問你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strict. Your chat model approves a step in Poki’s own chat only when you asked for that exact action. You are asked about the rest." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "严格。在 Poki 自己的聊天中，只有你明确要求过该操作时，聊天模型才会批准。其余的会询问你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "嚴格。在 Poki 自己的聊天中，只有你明確要求過該操作時，聊天模型才會批准。其餘的會詢問你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask for Everything. Nothing is approved automatically. Steps that follow straight after your answer in the same app do not ask again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部询问。不会自动批准任何步骤。在同一 App 中紧接你回答之后的步骤不会再次询问。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部詢問。不會自動批准任何步驟。在同一 App 中緊接你回答之後的步驟不會再次詢問。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set an address first" : {
