          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki could not open its own automation session (%@), and the loopback refused the connection. Check the loopback in Setup, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 未能打开自身的自动化会话（%@），回环也拒绝了连接。在配置中检查回环，然后再试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 未能開啟自身的自動化會話（%@），迴環也拒絕了連線。在配置中檢查迴環，然後再試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki could not open its own automation session (%@). Connect to Wi-Fi and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 未能打开自身的自动化会话（%@）。连上 Wi-Fi 后再试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
