            "value" : "Poki Runner"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki closes by itself so agents can see the screen again. Open Poki again afterwards, from the notification or the Home Screen. It turns on when it opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 会自动关闭以恢复智能体的屏幕画面。请从通知或主屏幕重新打开 Poki，打开后会自动开启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 會自動關閉以恢復智慧體的螢幕畫面。請從通知或主畫面重新開啟 Poki，開啟後會自動開啟。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki closes automatically so agents can see the screen again. Reopen Poki from the notification or Home Screen to turn it back on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter Your Passcode Next" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接下来请输入锁屏密码"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接下來請輸入鎖屏密碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the first time Poki starts automation since your iPhone restarted, so iOS will ask for your passcode on the next screen. That screen belongs to iOS. Poki can’t see or read what you enter, and it asks only once until the next restart." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是 iPhone 重新启动后 Poki 首次启动自动化，因此 iOS 会在下一个屏幕要求输入锁屏密码。该屏幕属于 iOS。Poki 无法看到或读取你输入的内容，并且在下次重新启动前只会询问一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是 iPhone 重新啟動後 Poki 首次啟動自動化，因此 iOS 會在下一個螢幕要求輸入鎖屏密碼。該螢幕屬於 iOS。Poki 無法看到或讀取你輸入的內容，並且在下次重新啟動前只會詢問一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. The agent waits and sends nothing until you tap Done on the Live Activity." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@。智能体会等待，在你轻点实时活动上的“完成”前不会发送任何内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@。智慧體會等待，在你輕點即時動態上的「完成」前不會傳送任何內容。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@. The agent waits and sends nothing until you tap Done on the Live Activity."
