    },
    "Both off by default. ask_poki lets outside agents hand a repetitive task to Poki's own agent. The auto-classifier answers approvals in your place: it asks your chat model, out of sight, whether what you said asks for the step, and allows or refuses it with nothing for you to tap; a yes from you in the chat or a live call lets a refused step through next time. With no chat model set up it refuses every sensitive step. Changes take effect the next time Poki opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两项默认关闭。ask_poki 允许外部智能体将重复性任务交给 Poki 内置智能体。自动判断会在后台通过对话模型判断当前步骤是否符合你的要求并直接放行或拒绝；在对话或语音中回复“允许”可在下次放行被拒步骤。未配置对话模型时会拒绝所有敏感步骤。下次启动生效。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Both off by default. ask_poki lets external agents hand repetitive tasks to Poki’s built-in agent. Auto-Classifier handles approvals silently using your chat model based on your request; replying yes in chat or voice lets a refused step through next time. Without a chat model, all sensitive steps are refused. Takes effect next launch."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兩項預設關閉。ask_poki 允許外部智慧體將重複性任務交給 Poki 內建智慧體。自動判斷會在背景透過對話模型判斷目前步驟是否符合你的要求並直接放行或拒絕；在對話或語音中回覆「允許」可在下次放行被拒步驟。未設定對話模型時會拒絕所有敏感步驟。下次啟動生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Models" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Models"
