          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permissive, Balanced and Strict let your chat model approve steps in Poki’s own chat that fit what you asked for, and only ask you about the rest. The chat and the Activity Log show each decision." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "宽松、均衡与严格模式可让对话模型在 Poki 对话中自动批准符合你要求的步骤，其余情况再向你确认。每次决定都会记录在对话和活动日志中。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Permissive, Balanced, and Strict let your chat model approve steps in Poki’s chat that match your request, asking you only about the rest. Every decision appears in chat and Activity Log."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "寬鬆、均衡與嚴格模式可讓對話模型在 Poki 對話中自動批准符合你要求的步驟，其餘情況再向你確認。每次決定都會記錄在對話和活動日誌中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
