    },
    "Open **Poki Setup** on your Mac or PC, connect this iPhone by cable, and tap **Pair**. Tap **Trust** on the iPhone when asked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Mac 或 PC 上打开 **Poki Setup**，用线缆连接此 iPhone，然后轻点**配对**。iPhone 询问时请轻点**信任**。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Mac 或 PC 上開啟 **Poki Setup**，用線纜連線此 iPhone，然後輕點**配對**。iPhone 詢問時請輕點**信任**。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send the pairing file here. Tap **Scan Pairing Code** below (or scan Poki Setup's code with the Camera), AirDrop the file to this iPhone and open it with Poki, or tap **Import Pairing File** below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将配对文件发送到这里。轻点下方的**扫描配对码**（或用“相机”扫描 Poki Setup 的二维码），通过隔空投送将文件发送到此 iPhone 并用 Poki 打开，或轻点下方的**导入配对文件**。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將配對檔案傳送到這裡。輕點下方的**掃描配對碼**（或用「相機」掃描 Poki Setup 的二維碼），透過隔空投送將檔案傳送到此 iPhone 並用 Poki 開啟，或輕點下方的**匯入配對檔案**。"
          }
        }
      }
