            "value" : "Opens Setup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set your relay first. Each agent gets its own MCP address on it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先设置中转。每个智能体在中转上都有独立的 MCP 地址。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請先設定中轉。每個智慧體在中轉上都有獨立的 MCP 位址。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set your relay first. Each agent gets its own MCP address on it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each agent gets its own MCP address. Add it as a remote MCP server in Claude, Codex or any MCP client. It takes the agent’s name and icon when the agent first connects, unless you renamed it. Swipe to revoke." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个智能体都有独立的 MCP 地址，可在 Claude、Codex 等客户端添加为远程 MCP 服务器。首次连接自动同步名称与图标（已重命名除外）。轻扫可撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個智慧體都有獨立的 MCP 位址，可在 Claude、Codex 等用戶端新增為遠端 MCP 伺服器。首次連線自動同步名稱與圖示（已重新命名除外）。輕掃可撤銷。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each agent gets its own MCP address. Add it as a remote MCP server in Claude, Codex, or any MCP client. Name and icon sync on first connection unless renamed. Swipe to revoke."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The phone stays where the task ended. Poki’s reply comes as a notification. Touch and hold it to answer and carry on from there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手机停留在任务结束的地方。Poki 的回复会以通知送达。按住通知即可回答并从那里继续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手機停留在任務結束的地方。Poki 的回覆會以通知送達。按住通知即可回答並從那裡繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki keeps the password in this iPhone’s Keychain to sign itself again every week." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 将密码保存在此 iPhone 的钥匙串中，以便每周为自己重新签名。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 將密碼儲存在此 iPhone 的鑰匙串中，以便每週為自己重新簽名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki signs in again when its signing is due, and asks you for the password then." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "签名到期时 Poki 会重新登录，届时会向你询问密码。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "簽名到期時 Poki 會重新登入，屆時會向你詢問密碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share Run Log for Maintainers" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与维护者共享运行日志"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "與維護者共享執行日誌"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional, for live voice without an OpenAI key on this iPhone. Run bin/voice-bridge.mjs on your Mac and enter the address it gives." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可选，用于本机未配置 OpenAI 密钥时开启实时语音。在 Mac 上运行 bin/voice-bridge.mjs 并输入输出的地址。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可選，用於本機未設定 OpenAI 金鑰時開啟即時語音。在 Mac 上執行 bin/voice-bridge.mjs 並輸入輸出的位址。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optional, for Live Voice without an OpenAI key on this iPhone. Run bin/voice-bridge.mjs on your Mac and enter the address it prints."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No extra app needed. Poki connects only to this iPhone. Your normal traffic and DNS stay on their usual routes. iOS shows it as a VPN, so it may disconnect another VPN app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无需额外 App。Poki 只连接此 iPhone。你平常的流量和 DNS 仍走原来的路线。iOS 会将它显示为 VPN，因此可能会断开其他 VPN App。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無需額外 App。Poki 只連線此 iPhone。你平常的流量和 DNS 仍走原來的路線。iOS 會將它顯示為 VPN，因此可能會斷開其他 VPN App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This happens after a restore, a reset of Location & Privacy, or when the phone forgot Poki. Pair again from Poki Setup on your computer and send the new file here. The old key is replaced." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复 iPhone、还原“位置与隐私”或 iPhone 忘记 Poki 后会出现这种情况。请在电脑上的 Poki Setup 中重新配对，并将新文件发送到这里。旧密钥会被替换。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢復 iPhone、還原「位置與隱私」或 iPhone 忘記 Poki 後會出現這種情況。請在電腦上的 Poki Setup 中重新配對，並將新檔案傳送到這裡。舊金鑰會被替換。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki stays active in the background without the location indicator, and never records your location." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 在后台保持运行且不显示定位图标，绝不记录位置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 在背景保持執行且不顯示定位圖示，絕不記錄位置。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki stays active in the background without the location indicator and never records your location."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location Services is off for Poki. It keeps itself running with silent audio, which iOS may stop during calls or other audio." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 的定位服务已关闭。它改用静音音频保持运行，通话或播放其他音频时 iOS 可能会停止它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 的定位服務已關閉。它改用靜音音訊保持執行，通話或播放其他音訊時 iOS 可能會停止它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS needs a background mode to keep apps running. Poki uses lowest-accuracy location with Always Allow, which shows no location indicator, and never records your location." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 要求启用后台模式以保持运行。Poki 采用“始终允许”的最低精度定位，不显示定位图标，也绝不记录位置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 要求啟用背景模式以保持執行。Poki 採用「永遠允許」的最低精度定位，不顯示定位圖示，也絕不記錄位置。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS requires a background mode to keep apps active. Poki uses lowest-accuracy location with Always Allow, showing no indicator and never recording your location."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Background App Refresh on for Poki. With it off, iOS stops Poki soon after it leaves the screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请为 Poki 开启“后台 App 刷新”，避免离开应用后被 iOS 挂起。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請為 Poki 開啟「背景 App 重新整理」，避免離開應用程式後被 iOS 暫停。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep Background App Refresh on for Poki so iOS doesn’t suspend it when you leave the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Background App Refresh is restricted on this iPhone (Low Power Mode, Screen Time or a profile turns it off), so iOS may stop Poki in the background." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请关闭低电量模式，或检查屏幕使用时间与描述文件限制。“后台 App 刷新”受限时，iOS 可能会在后台挂起 Poki。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請關閉低耗電模式，或檢查螢幕使用時間與描述檔限制。「背景 App 重新整理」受限時，iOS 可能會在背景暫停 Poki。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn off Low Power Mode or check Screen Time and profiles. Background App Refresh is restricted, so iOS may suspend Poki."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on **Background App Refresh** on Poki’s page in Settings, and under Settings › General › Background App Refresh. With it off, iOS stops Poki soon after it leaves the screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在“设置 › Poki”及“设置 › 通用 › 后台 App 刷新”中开启**后台 App 刷新**，避免离开屏幕后被 iOS 停止。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請在「設定 › Poki」及「設定 › 一般 › 背景 App 重新整理」中開啟**背景 App 重新整理**，避免離開畫面後被 iOS 停止。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn on **Background App Refresh** in Settings › Poki and Settings › General › Background App Refresh so iOS doesn’t stop Poki in the background."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki shows steps, pairing codes and approvals on the Lock Screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 会在锁定屏幕上显示步骤、配对码和批准请求。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 會在鎖定螢幕上顯示步驟、配對碼和批准請求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn them on to see the agent’s steps and approve sensitive actions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
