    "Everything Poki needs is in place." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 所需的一切都已就绪。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 所需的一切都已就緒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs every item ticked before an agent or the chat can use this iPhone. Items tick themselves when the phone can check them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完成全部项目后，智能体和对话即可使用此 iPhone。可自动检测的项目会自动勾选。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完成全部項目後，智慧體和對話即可使用此 iPhone。可自動檢測的項目會自動勾選。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Complete every item so agents and chat can use this iPhone. Checkable items update automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs it once after each restart, then tries again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次重启后需联网一次，随后会自动重试。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki needs internet once after each restart, then retries automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次重啟後需連網一次，隨後會自動重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS shows the automation banner only while Poki’s automation session is open. Poki opens it when an agent asks and closes it when idle. Memory holds the routines and notes every agent shares." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅在自动化会话开启时显示系统横幅，智能体请求时开启、闲置时关闭。“记忆”保存所有智能体共享的流程与备忘。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅在自動化工作階段開啟時顯示系統橫幅，智慧體請求時開啟、閒置時關閉。「記憶」儲存所有智慧體共享的流程與備忘。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS shows the automation banner only during an active session. Poki opens it on agent request and closes it when idle. Memory stores shared routines and notes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Memory holds the routines and notes every agent shares." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“记忆”保存所有智能体共享的流程与备忘。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「記憶」儲存所有智慧體共享的流程與備忘。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Memory stores routines and notes shared across agents."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Memory holds the routines and notes every agent shares. Approvals asks you before an agent pays, deletes, sends a message, places a call, types a password or does anything in Wallet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“记忆”保存所有智能体共享的流程与备忘。“批准”会在智能体付款、删除、发消息、打电话、输密码或操作“钱包”前先向你确认。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Memory stores shared routines and notes. Approvals asks before an agent pays, deletes, sends messages, places calls, enters passwords, or uses Wallet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「記憶」儲存所有智慧體共享的流程與備忘。「批准」會在智慧體付款、刪除、傳訊息、打電話、輸密碼或操作「錢包」前先向你確認。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
