            "value" : "請在此重新連線；若反覆中斷，請檢查簽名是否含網路延伸功能或改用外部連線。本機 VPN 已中斷。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reconnect here, or choose an external connection if signing lacks Network Extensions. The local VPN disconnected."
