    "The relay forwards requests to this iPhone while Poki is open or in the background. It stores nothing; when offline, clients receive an error." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 在前台或后台运行时，中转会将请求转发至此 iPhone，不存储任何数据。设备离线时客户端会收到错误提示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 在前景或背景執行時，中轉會將請求轉發至此 iPhone，不儲存任何資料。裝置離線時用戶端會收到錯誤提示。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The relay forwards requests to this iPhone while Poki is open or in the background. It stores nothing; when offline, clients receive an error."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This happens after a restore, a reset of Location & Privacy, or when the phone forgot Poki. Pair again; the old key is replaced." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复 iPhone、还原“位置与隐私”或 iPhone 忘记 Poki 后会出现这种情况。重新配对即可，旧密钥会被替换。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回復 iPhone、重置「位置與隱私權」或 iPhone 忘記 Poki 後會出現這種情況。重新配對即可，舊金鑰會被取代。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a free Apple ID, self-signed apps expire after 7 days and are limited to 3 at a time; Poki and Poki Runner use 2. For free Apple ID signing, install the external-connection build and use LocalDevVPN or a compatible VPN app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用免费 Apple 账户自签名的应用 7 天后到期，且最多同时安装 3 个（Poki 和 Poki Runner 占 2 个）。请安装外部连接版，并搭配 LocalDevVPN 或兼容 VPN 使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用免費 Apple 帳號自簽名的應用程式 7 天後到期，且最多同時安裝 3 個（Poki 和 Poki Runner 佔 2 個）。請安裝外部連線版，並搭配 LocalDevVPN 或相容 VPN 使用。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With a free Apple Account, self-signed apps expire after 7 days and are limited to 3 at a time (Poki and Poki Runner use 2). Install the external-connection build with LocalDevVPN or a compatible VPN app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS asks for the passcode before UI Automation after Poki Runner was force-closed or the iPhone restarted. Enter it once; Poki carries on by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki Runner 被强制退出或 iPhone 重新启动后，iOS 会先要求输入锁屏密码，再允许 UI 自动化。只需输入一次，Poki 会自动继续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki Runner 被強制關閉或 iPhone 重新啟動後，iOS 會先要求輸入鎖定畫面密碼，再允許 UI 自動化。只需輸入一次，Poki 會自動繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS asks for the passcode to allow UI Automation after Poki restarts, or 8 hours after it was last entered. Enter it once; Poki carries on by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 重启后，或距上次输入密码超过 8 小时，iOS 会要求输入密码以允许 UI 自动化。输入一次即可，Poki 会自己继续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 重新啟動後，或距上次輸入密碼超過 8 小時，iOS 會要求輸入密碼以允許 UI 自動化。輸入一次即可，Poki 會自行繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Line" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "换行"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
