    },
    "To download updates by itself, Poki needs your Apple Account: sign in under Signing Options. Or update Poki from Poki Setup on your Mac." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sign in to your Apple Account under Signing Options so Poki can download updates automatically, or update via Poki Setup on your Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“签名选项”中登录 Apple 账户即可自动下载更新，也可通过 Mac 上的 Poki Setup 更新。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在「簽名選項」中登入 Apple 帳號即可自動下載更新，也可透過 Mac 上的 Poki Setup 更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finishing the update: Poki will close to finish it" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Closing Poki to finish the update"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在关闭 Poki 以完成更新"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在關閉 Poki 以完成更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A free Apple Account works: Poki signs itself for 7 days at a time and gets ready to sign again before then. Your Apple ID and password go only to Apple. The anisette server Poki asks for its device headers never sees them." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A free Apple Account works. Poki signs itself for 7 days at a time and prepares the next renewal automatically. Your Apple ID and password go only to Apple; the anisette server never sees them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免费 Apple 账户即可使用。Poki 每次签名有效期 7 天，到期前会自动准备续签。Apple ID 和密码仅发送给 Apple，anisette 服务器无法读取。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免費 Apple 帳號即可使用。Poki 每次簽名有效期 7 天，到期前會自動準備續簽。Apple ID 和密碼僅傳送給 Apple，anisette 伺服器無法讀取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki prepares updates from this channel and more stable channels. If none has a release, it uses the next available less stable channel." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki prepares updates from this channel and more stable channels. If none has a release, it uses the next available less stable channel."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 会从此通道及更稳定的通道准备更新。如果均无可用版本，会使用下一个有版本的较不稳定通道。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 會從此通道及更穩定的通道準備更新。如果均無可用版本，會使用下一個有版本的較不穩定通道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the pairing file from a computer does not work over the loopback on this iOS version. Pair this iPhone here once; the pairing stays." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pair directly on this iPhone once (the pairing stays). Computer pairing files don’t work over Loopback on this iOS version."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在此 iPhone 上直接配对一次（配对会保留）。当前 iOS 版本不支持通过回环使用电脑配对文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請在此 iPhone 上直接配對一次（配對會保留）。目前 iOS 版本不支援透過迴環使用電腦配對檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Poki so agents can see the screen again: it restarts once." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open Poki so agents can see the screen again. It will restart once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请打开 Poki 以恢复智能体的屏幕画面（将重启一次）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請開啟 Poki 以恢復智慧體的螢幕畫面（將重啟一次）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki uses your ChatGPT Plus or Pro plan through OpenAI’s Sign in with ChatGPT. The sign-in stays in this iPhone’s Keychain. An OpenAI API key works too, as a backup: add it under OpenAI." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki uses your ChatGPT Plus or Pro plan via Sign in with ChatGPT, stored in this iPhone’s Keychain. You can also add an OpenAI API key under OpenAI as a backup."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 通过“使用 ChatGPT 登录”共享你的 ChatGPT Plus 或 Pro 额度，登录信息保存在本机钥匙串中。也可在 OpenAI 下添加 API 密钥作为备用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 透過「使用 ChatGPT 登入」共享你的 ChatGPT Plus 或 Pro 額度，登入資訊儲存在本機鑰匙圈中。也可在 OpenAI 下新增 API 金鑰作為備用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live voice is a spoken conversation with OpenAI’s Realtime model: it listens, taps and types, and answers out loud." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Live Voice is a spoken conversation with OpenAI’s Realtime model. Poki listens, acts on screen, and replies aloud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实时语音通过 OpenAI Realtime 模型进行语音对话，支持边听边操作并朗读回答。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即時語音透過 OpenAI Realtime 模型進行語音對話，支援邊聽邊操作並朗讀回答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LocalDevVPN" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "LocalDevVPN"
