          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send the pairing file here: tap **Scan Pairing Code** below (or scan Poki Setup's code with the Camera), AirDrop the file to this iPhone and open it with Poki, or tap **Import Pairing File** below." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Send the pairing file here: tap **Scan Pairing Code** below (or scan with Camera), AirDrop the file to this iPhone and open with Poki, or tap **Import Pairing File**."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将配对文件发到此手机：轻点下方**扫描配对码**（或用系统相机扫码），通过隔空投送发来并用 Poki 打开，或轻点**导入配对文件**。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將配對檔案傳到此手機：輕點下方**掃描配對碼**（或用系統相機掃碼），透過 AirDrop 傳來並用 Poki 開啟，或輕點**匯入配對檔案**。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Poki Setup yet? Any lockdown pairing file works: pymobiledevice3, jitterbugpair or StikPair make one." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No Poki Setup yet? Any lockdown pairing file works, such as one from pymobiledevice3, jitterbugpair, or StikPair."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "还没有 Poki Setup？任何标准 lockdown 配对文件均可使用（可用 pymobiledevice3、jitterbugpair 或 StikPair 生成）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "還沒有 Poki Setup？任何標準 lockdown 配對檔案均可使用（可用 pymobiledevice3、jitterbugpair 或 StikPair 產生）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the chat, the waveform button starts a live conversation: Poki listens, acts and answers out loud. It ends by itself 8 seconds after an answer if nobody speaks, and when Poki goes to the background (once a running step is done). Tap End to stop sooner. The microphone in the message field only dictates." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In chat, tap the waveform button to start Live Voice. Poki listens, acts, and replies aloud. It ends automatically if nobody speaks for 8 seconds after an answer, or when Poki enters the background once a running step finishes. Tap End to stop early. The message field mic is for dictation only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在对话中轻点波形按钮即可开启实时语音，Poki 会边听边操作并朗读回答。回答后 8 秒内无人说话，或切至后台（当前运行步骤完成后）时会自动结束；轻点“结束”可提前停止。输入框麦克风仅用于听写。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在對話中輕點波形按鈕即可開啟即時語音，Poki 會邊聽邊操作並朗讀回答。回答後 8 秒內無人說話，或切至背景（目前執行步驟完成後）時會自動結束；輕點「結束」可提前停止。輸入框麥克風僅用於聽寫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs the microphone and speech recognition: allow them in Settings › Poki." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Allow Microphone and Speech Recognition in Settings › Poki."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在“设置 › Poki”中开启麦克风和语音识别权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請在「設定 › Poki」中開啟麥克風與語音辨識權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ends the automation session, and iOS’s banner with it, when the agent stops. Being tested: if the agent can’t see the screen after this, turn it off and open Poki again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ends the automation session and hides the iOS banner when the agent stops (experimental). If agents lose screen view afterward, turn this off and reopen Poki."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体停止时结束自动化会话并隐藏 iOS 横幅（实验性）。若此后智能体无法读取屏幕，请关闭此项并重开 Poki。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智慧體停止時結束自動化工作階段並隱藏 iOS 橫幅（實驗性）。若此後智慧體無法讀取螢幕，請關閉此項並重開 Poki。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An agent saves a routine after a task that worked; the next time it repeats the task in one step and stops where the screen differs. Swipe a routine to forget it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After a successful task, an agent saves a routine to repeat it in one step next time, pausing if the screen differs. Swipe to forget."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任务成功后，智能体会保存流程以便下次一步重放，遇到界面变化则自动停下。轻扫可删除流程。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任務成功後，智慧體會儲存流程以便下次一步重放，遇到畫面變化則自動停下。輕掃可刪除流程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One file with every routine and note. Importing merges it in; the newer copy of a routine wins. Poki Setup on your computer can back it up and put it back." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exports one file with all routines and notes. Importing merges entries, keeping newer versions. Poki Setup on your computer can also back up and restore it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将所有流程和备忘导出为单个文件。导入时自动合并并保留较新版本，也可用电脑上的 Poki Setup 备份与恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將所有流程和備忘匯出為單一檔案。匯入時自動合併並保留較新版本，也可用電腦上的 Poki Setup 備份與還原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
