    "No extra app needed. Poki connects only to this iPhone; your normal traffic and DNS stay on their usual routes. iOS shows it as a VPN, so it may disconnect another VPN app." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No extra app needed. Poki connects only to this iPhone; your normal traffic and DNS stay on their usual routes. iOS shows it as a VPN, so it may disconnect another VPN app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无需额外应用。Poki 仅连接此 iPhone 本机，日常流量和 DNS 仍走原有线路。iOS 会将其显示为 VPN，开启时可能会断开其他 VPN 应用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無需額外應用程式。Poki 僅連線此 iPhone 本機，日常流量和 DNS 仍走原有線路。iOS 會將其顯示為 VPN，開啟時可能會中斷其他 VPN 應用程式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This happens after a restore, a reset of Location & Privacy, or when the phone forgot Poki. Pair again from Poki Setup on your computer and send the new file here; the old key is replaced." : {
