    },
    "The loopback is on. iOS moved its pairing service to another port, and Poki finds it through the local network. Keep Wi-Fi on and allow Local Network for Poki in Settings → Privacy & Security. If this stays, restart the iPhone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回环已开启。iOS 把配对服务换到了另一个端口，Poki 会通过本地网络找到它。请保持无线局域网开启，并在“设置 › 隐私与安全 › 本地网络”中允许 Poki。如果仍未恢复，请重新启动 iPhone。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "迴環已開啟。iOS 把配對服務換到了另一個連接埠，Poki 會透過區域網路找到它。請保持無線區域網開啟，並在「設定 › 隱私權與安全性 › 區域網路」中允許 Poki。如果仍未恢復，請重新啟動 iPhone。"
          }
        }
      }
